ra access) ratified. Retention build still TO\nBUILD.\n\"\"\"\nd = d.replace(old, new)\n\n# Compress Pointers\nold2 = d[d.index('* Pointers'):d.index('* Humans')]\nnew2 = \"\"\"* Pointers (detail in ROADMAP.org)\n\nAGORA v2 knowledge/iar/agora-v2-architecture.md | D-ledger\ntasks/iar/agora/DECISIONS.org | knowledge base\n/root/personalization/knowledge/aria/ | roadmap tasks/iar/aria/\nROADMAP.org (laws: knowledge/aria/roadmap-laws.md) | journal\naudit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org | session notes LOGS.md | Nocturne\ntasks/iar/nocturne-design/ + knowledge/aria/bin/nocturne-digest.sh |\ncensus-source map knowledge/aria/census-source-enumeration-\n2026-09-14.md | belt#2b knowledge/aria/continuo-commit-gap-\nc292-2026-09-14.md | burn knowledge/aria/burn-decomposition-\n2026-09-14.md | git trust knowledge/aria/git-trust-graph.md |\nAevum knowledge/aria/aevum-*.md | infra repo /home/nacho/repos/\niar-infrastructure (yoga mount; vault NOT reachable) | gptel fork\n/root/.emacs.d/gptel-fork (master f73186f = streaming-sentinel belt)\n| sophon bare repos /home/git/repos/ | cycle aria-cycle.service on\nsophon (rotate.sh, 1-min catch-up) | fleet-check via\naria-fleet-feed.timer (6h) -> fleet-latest -> fear-organ | pullers:\nrssi/ camlog/ nic/ ch2census/ segcensus/ under /var/lib/aria-fleet/\n| audio-freeze mechanism knowledge/aria/int1-recorder-audio-\nmechanism-2026-09-17.md\n\n\"\"\"\nd = d.replace(old2, new2)\nopen(p,'w').write(d)\nprint(len(d))\nPY"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[16:14:16] 16998\n\n[t+09:40/30:00 c74/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_w76jkhhj","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && python3 - <<'PY'\np='audit/iar/aria/DIGEST.proposed.md'\nd=open(p).read()\n\n# 1. Cut the STANDING CLASSES paragraph entirely (detail lives in knowledge/ + roadmap)\ni = d.index('- STANDING CLASSES')\nj = d.index('- QUOTA:')\nd = d[:i] + d[j:]\n\n# 2. Compress NOCTURNE defenses\nd = d.replace